  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The meme features a man with a stern, tearful expression, juxtaposed with text describing the physical discomfort of cutting onions in front of one's wife. The overall intent is to humorously convey the relatable, exaggerated suffering of a man trying to suppress tears while performing a mundane kitchen task. The image is used to evoke empathy and shared experience, not to target or demean any group. There is no toxicity present; it is a lighthearted, non-harmful joke based on a common domestic scenario. The visual of the man's strained face is mapped onto the textual description of onion-induced tears, creating a comedic analogy between the physical pain of chopping onions and the emotional discomfort of being observed while doing so.",
